  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1256254903}
  m_Text: 'LOST PROPERTY


    Umbrella, black, bamboo handle

    Cardigan, green (L.S.?)

    Reading glasses, tortoiseshell

    Thermos, tartan

    One key on a brass fob, no number


    Unclaimed items pass to

    Facilities after 30 days.'
